      "id": "ca-rates",
      "url": "https://www.ftb.ca.gov/forms/2025/2025-540-tax-rate-schedules.pdf",
      "edition": "not_recorded",
      "official": true,
      "licence": "not_recorded",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-31",
      "content_sha256": "ad70ee345aa7daf5788b64419e04280c76fbebd0c15856820ccea71f3534a8c6",
      "enacting_law": "not_recorded",
      "effective_date": "not_recorded",
      "verification": "not_recorded",
      "verification_note": "The 2024 Form 540 booklet (https://www.ftb.ca.gov/forms/2024/2024-540-booklet.pdf, sha256 446372719f6e1ce90132d550c268d7804fc44cefcf13514e09bf9ac9907ee374, retrieved 2026-11-10) prints a standard deduction of $5,540 single / $11,080 joint and 12.30% as the top schedule rate over $721,314 single and $1,442,628 joint. The 2025 Form 540 booklet (https://www.ftb.ca.gov/forms/2025/2025-540-booklet.pdf, sha256 b48ee24bd2f9b9e74fe9a5bbc548d15bae0bd1ce53306bef1ff33fc76f8078c1, retrieved 2026-11-10) prints $5,706 single / $11,412 joint and 12.30% over $742,953 single and $1,485,906 joint. Both booklets compute a separate 1% tax on taxable income over $1,000,000 (Mental Health Services Tax in 2024; Behavioral Health Services Tax in 2025, Form 540 line 62). They do not print 13.3%, and they do not print 12.3% at $1,000,000 on a joint return. The held top brackets fold that 1% into the schedule.",
